g"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pseudo-random function extension for deriving symmetric secrets bound to a credential.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"PRF","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" lets a relying party derive deterministic symmetric secrets from a credential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"— the same input produces the same output every time the user authenticates with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that credential. It’s the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/www.w3.org\/TR\/webauthn-3\/#prf-extension","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for credential-bound key derivation, built on the CTAP2 "},{"code":"hmac-secret","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" extension."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The SDK transforms each PRF input with "},{"code":"SHA-256(\"WebAuthn PRF\\0\" || input)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" before"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sending it to the authenticator — that domain separation is mandated by the spec."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In a high-level WebAuthn flow, configure "},{"code":"PRF","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" per ceremony via"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/RegistrationInputs\/prf","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/AuthenticationInputs\/prf","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"; outputs come back on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"clientExtensionResults","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" of the corresponding "},{"code":"Response","typ